desc.1383000:
Practices Divination on a target’s fate and inflicts a random card effect from below:
★Temperance: Reduce Phy. ATK and M. ATK by %s% for 10 seconds;
★The Hanged Man: Reduce Attack SPD and Move SPD by %s% for 10  ;
★Judgement: Reduce all attribute point by %s for 20 seconds;
★The Hermit: Cannot use Skills or Attack for %s secs
★Death: Reduce HP by current HP x%s%. When it is effective on MVP and Mini Monsters, the HP loss will decrease to a fixed amount.
★The Fool: Reduce SP by current SP x%s%
